     "solution_type": "detailed",
     "content_html": "These drugs prevent the enzyme cholinesterase from breaking down ACh, allowing more of this neurotransmitter to accumulate in the synapses and continuing to stimulate the cholinergic receptors at the NMJ. This stimulation causes increased skeletal muscle contraction."
